---
import shorthairColor from "../assets/landing/shorthair-color.svg";
---

<section class="landing" data-testid="landing-section">
  <div class="landing-slide" data-slide>
    <img class="landing-cavy" src={shorthairColor.src} alt="" />
    <h1>Interactive Guinea Pig Domestication</h1>
    <p class="landing-hint">Scroll to begin ↓</p>
  </div>
  <div class="landing-slide" data-slide>
    <p>
      Guinea pigs (cavies) were once wild rodents living on the grasslands of the
      Andes, fleeing anything that moved. Over roughly 6,000 years, Andean
      communities bred them for food and companionship, Europeans later bred
      them purely for looks, and today's pet breeds &mdash; Abyssinians,
      Peruvians, Teddies, and more &mdash; are the result.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="landing-slide" data-slide>
    <p>
      You'll play the role of the breeder. Each generation, choose 2 or more
      cavies to be parents &mdash; their traits and coat pass on to their
      offspring, with a little variation. Select for docility, for roundness,
      for boldness, for colour: whatever you choose for is what the
      population drifts toward. Advance through history's real eras as your
      population changes, and see how far your wild founders travelled by the
      end.
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="start-button" data-testid="start-button">Start</button>
  </div>
</section>
